    <forceEntry id="5392-39c4-501b-622c" name="Legio Custodes (Allied Contingent)" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="9bd5-bf52-2a01-3868" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 5. Formation initiative 1+.
3 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
Each upgrade may only be taken once per detachment.
Up to 1/2 of the army's points may be spent on Allies and/or Lords of War.
The wiki gives the strategy rating as "1+", which appears to be a typo; Departmento Munitorum uses 5.
The wiki does not list which armies are cohesive or disruptive allies for Legio Custodes.
Allied Contingent: formations here count towards the primary army's Allies &amp; Lords of War allowance. Supreme Commanders must come from the primary army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
